'@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 前端用例 — 用户操作
skinparam useCaseShape rectangle

actor "未授权用户" as G
actor "用户" as U
actor "维修人员" as M

usecase "注册/登录" as LOG
usecase "查看站点列表" as VSL
usecase "选择充电桩" as SC
usecase "余额校验" as BC
usecase "启动/结束充电" as CS
usecase "充值支付" as PAY
usecase "查看充电记录" as VCR
usecase "提交报修" as SRT
usecase "处理报修" as HR
usecase "充电记录快捷视图" as QV
usecase "充电桩状态快捷查询" as QC

G --> LOG
U --> VSL
U --> SC
U --> CS
U --> PAY
U --> VCR
U --> SRT
U --> QV
U --> QC
M --> VSL
M --> SC
M --> CS
M --> PAY
M --> VCR
M --> SRT
M --> HR
note right of M : 维修人员仅操作自己的充电/支付记录\n及被分配的报修单，不可越权访问其他用户数据
CS <.left. BC : <<include>>
note bottom of CS : 启动前校验余额 >= 10元
M --> QV
M --> QC
@enduml